Z||000000||Oreif||01-04-2001||02:30 PM||||Hey All, I have started working on my Stereo Installation. I am replacing the 4 X 10's in the front with Polk Audio 4" seperates and also replacing the 4 X 6's with the same. Below are the pics so far. What do you all think of it?<P>Sail Panel Tweeters.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tweeters.jpg"> <P>Dash Speakers.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/speaker1_1.jpg"> <BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
