Z||000029||Raydar||01-09-2001||10:33 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Oreif:<BR><B><BR>...but it will be very clean sounding with excellent tonal quality...   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Everything that I've heard about Polks would lead me to believe exactly that. Sounds like you've got it down to a science, too.<BR>Anybody can do SPL. It's high fidelity that's difficult. <P><p>[This message has been edited by Raydar (edited 01-09-2001).]||||reg||1
